  "remarks": "\nThe Somali Battalion is an armed separatist group and is part of the so-called \"1st Army Corps\" of the \"Donetsk People's Republic\". The group has actively supported actions which undermine the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine and to further destabilise Ukraine. The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
